 "source": "struct T { int k; T* left; T* right; };\nT* insert(T* r, int k) {\n    if (!r) return new T{k, nullptr, nullptr};\n    if (k < r->k) r->left = insert(r->left, k); else r->right = insert(r->right, k);\n    return r;\n}\nint main() {\n    T* root = nullptr;\n    int keys[3] = {5, 2, 8};\n    for (int i = 0; i < 3; i++) root = insert(root, keys[i]);\n    return root->k;\n}\n",
